                "text": "Yesterday, I met with Cruz Hernandez and his family to talk about his time as a patient at UCSF Benioff Children\u2019s Hospital and the importance of Medicaid. I promised him that I am doing everything in my power to protect Medicaid and funding for medical research from Republican cuts so that families like Cruz\u2019s can continue to fight with hope in their hearts.",
