                "text": "Today, the Bay stood up to say there are NO Kings in America. As Donald Trump and House Republicans try to rip our health care and food assistance programs away and attack and deport members of our communities without due process, I couldn\u2019t be prouder to stand hand in hand with my neighbors to peacefully assert the power of the people. History is with us, we will win this fight.",
