                "text": "I have been an advocate in the Bay Area for thirty years. It\u2019s who I am. In the face of this Republican assault on our democracy, I\u2019m standing with you at protests and health centers in the Bay, and fighting for you in Washington. Thank you, for trusting me. https://t.co/cb3HwfFFdE",
