                "reply_count": 6,
                "retweet_count": 4,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I am here on the House floor fighting for us as Republicans try to push this horrific bill through. \u2028\u2028I introduced 6 amendments to:\u2028\u20281. Protect access to reproductive health services. \u00a0\u2028\u00a0\u20282. Protect folks\u2019 ability to participate in clinical trials.\u2028\u00a0\u20283. Protect patients\u2019 ability to access cancer treatment \u2013 including chemotherapy and radiation.\u2028\u00a0\u20284. Protect coverage for behavioral health care, including substance use disorder prevention, counseling, and medication assisted treatment.\u2028\u00a0\u20285. Protect the Consumer Directed Personal Assistance Program (CDPAP) program, which allows Medicaid beneficiaries in some states to have their family caregivers receive training and stipends to care for them.\u2028\u00a0\u20286. Protect SNAP and strike the provision that would raise work requirements for SNAP beneficiaries from age 54 to 64 years old.",
                "text_lang": "en",
